---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import ContactCTA from '../components/ContactCTA.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About Hostamble | Our Approach" description="Get to know Hostamble and how we think about making web hosting approachable for growing ideas.">
  <PageHero eyebrow="ABOUT HOSTAMBLE" title="A friendlier place on the internet." description="We're here for people with something to build, whether that's their first site or their next chapter." icon="h."/>
  <section class="inquiry-section section-pad"><div class="container inquiry-grid"><div><span class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-line"></span> OUR POINT OF VIEW</span><h2>More possibilities. <em>Less complexity.</em></h2></div><div class="about-prose"><p>Hostamble offers hosting and domain services for individuals and businesses. This redesign is shaped around a simple idea: make it easier to understand the options and take the next step.</p><p>Our new visual identity pairs a friendly lowercase wordmark with a compact “h.” symbol — a little home for big ideas. The mark is a working concept awaiting final brand approval.</p><a class="text-link" href="/support">Talk with the team →</a></div></div></section>
  <ContactCTA />
</BaseLayout>
